ion":"Returns a list of data tables.\nThere are two scenarios when listing data tables of the specified file:\n1. If the file type is `doc`, this API returns all the inline data tables in the file.\n2. If the file type is `data_table`, this API returns all the tables.\n\n**[Scopes](https://developers.zoom.us/docs/integrations/oauth-scopes-overview/):** `canvas_data_table:read`\n\n**[Granular Scopes](https://developers.zoom.us/docs/integrations/oauth-scopes-overview/):** `canvas:read:data_table`\n\n**[Rate Limit Label](https://marketplace.zoom.us/docs/api-reference/rate-limits#rate-limits):** `LIGHT`\n\n**Not supported in Gov cluster** ","operationId":"Listdatatablesinfile","parameters":[{"name":"fileId","in":"path","description":"The file ID.","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","example":"ADuV705lSXW4c6fBgQFarQ"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"**HTTP Status Code:** `200`  Data table list returned.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"required":["data_tables"],"type":"object","properties":{"data_tables":{"type":"array","description":"The data table list.","items":{"required":["data_table_id","is_synced","name"],"type":"object","properties":{"data_table_id":{"type":"string","description":"The data table ID.","example":"6108696fe9b44dc3a2675a448ab0c338"},"name":{"type":"string","description":"The table name.","example":"Project tracker"},"is_synced":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether the table is synchronized. If `true`, the table is synchronized. If `false`, the table is the source table.","example":false},"related_table":{"required":["data_table_id","file_id"],"type":"object","properties":{"file_id":{"type":"string","description":"The related file ID.","example":"Fk0XWCWSTJqgTDcxbAKLfQ"},"data_table_id":{"type":"string","description":"The related data table ID.","example":"c7628bc10b5a458cb7b4af3747cbf32d"}},"description":"If `is_synced` is `true`, `related_table` contains the metadata of the related table."},"integration":{"required":["integration_type"],"type":"object","properties":{"marketplace_app_id":{"type":"string","description":"If the data source originates from an app integrated via the marketplace, a `marketplace_app_id` is provided. If it does not originate from the marketplace, there is no `marketplace_app_id`.","example":"wc9NSSgESB-qLJed0RSZjQ"},"integration_type":{"type":"string","description":"The data integration type, such as `jira` and `meeting`.","example":"jira"}},"description":"If `integration` is not empty, the data in this table originates from external sources. This table has certain limitations:\n1. Integrated columns cannot be edited, whereas user-created columns are editable.\n2. Editing of rows is not permitted."}}}}}}}}},"400":{"description":"**HTTP Status Code:** `400` <br>\n Bad Request  Invalid parameters. \n\n "},"403":{"description":"**HTTP Status Code:** `403` <br>\n Forbidden  Permission denied. \n\n **Error Code:** `2009` <br>\n No permission to access or modify this resource. <br>\n"},"404":{"description":"**HTTP Status Code:** `404` <br>\n Not Found  File not found. \n\n "},"429":{"description":"**HTTP Status Code:** `429` <br>\n Too Many Requests. For more information, see [rate limits](https://developers.zoom.us/docs/api/rate-limits/). \n\n "}},"security":[{"openapi_oauth":["canvas_data_table:read","canvas:read:data_table"],"openapi_authorization":[]}],"x-extensions":{"x-permissions":[],"x-macro-scopes":["canvas_data_table:read"],"x-granular-scopes":["canvas:read:data_table"]}}},"/docs/files/{fileId}/data_tables/{tableId}":{"patch":{"tags":["DataTable Content"],"summary":"Update table metadata","description":"Update the table metadata, such as the title.\n\n**[Scopes](https://developers.zoom.us/docs/integrations/oauth-scopes-overview/):** `canvas_data_table:update`\n\n**[Granular Scopes](https://developers.zoom.us/docs/integrations/oauth-scopes-overview/):** `canvas:update:data_table`\n\n**[Rate Limit Label](https://marketplace.zoom.us/docs/api-reference/rate-l